          )}
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm font-serif text-iron/60 pt-1">
          Published in <a href={doiUrl()} class="italic font-medium text-caprock hover:text-sage transition-colors" rel="noopener">{c.journal}</a> &bull; Vol. {c.volume}, No. {c.issue} ({c.monthYear}), pp. {pageRange()}
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Version wayfinding: a rights statement and a navigation control are
           two different jobs, so they are no longer one grey paragraph. -->
      <nav class="versions" aria-label="Versions of this article">
